    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Sketcher is a relaxing single-player drawing game with AI feedback.<br><br>Gain detailed insights about your drawing from AI and get personalized rewards. Earn gems and unlock new drawing tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have plenty of drawing tools to help, including a brush, eraser, paint bucket, and color palette, as well as more advanced features, such as a line tool for clean, straight lines and the ability to edit colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019re done drawing, submit your work to the AI. It will review the drawing and provide areas to improve on next time, as well as reward a fair number of gems. Use your gems to unlock more color swatches and extra drawing layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with a relaxing Lo-Fi soundtrack. There\u2019s no time limit or brush stroke limit; you are free to draw whatever you want, however you want, and you always get rewarded for your efforts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Sketcher is a relaxing single-player drawing game with AI feedback.<br><br>Gain detailed insights about your drawing from AI and get personalized rewards. Earn gems and unlock new drawing tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have plenty of drawing tools to help, including a brush, eraser, paint bucket, and color palette, as well as more advanced features, such as a line tool for clean, straight lines and the ability to edit colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019re done drawing, submit your work to the AI. It will review the drawing and provide areas to improve on next time, as well as reward a fair number of gems. Use your gems to unlock more color swatches and extra drawing layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with a relaxing Lo-Fi soundtrack. There\u2019s no time limit or brush stroke limit; you are free to draw whatever you want, however you want, and you always get rewarded for your efforts.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cozy Sketcher is a relaxing single-player drawing game with AI feedback. Gain detailed insights about your drawing from AI and get personalized rewards. Take on creative challenges, earn gems, and unlock new drawing tools.",
